{"strongs": "H1889", "word": "הֶאָח", "translit": "he.ach", "root": "דרר", "morph": "H:Intj", "pos": "interjection", "gloss": "Aha!", "definition": "הֶאָח interjection (onomatopoetic) expressing joy, Aha! always introduced by אָמַר , Isa 44:16 he says, Aha , I am warm, I have seen the fire. Of satisfaction over the misfortune of an enemy or rival, Ps 35:21 ; Ps 35:25 let them not say in their heart הֶאָח נַפְשֵׁנוּ Aha , so would we have it ! ( lit our desire !) Ps 40:16 (= Ps 70:4 ), Ezek 25:3 ; Ezek 26:2 ; Ezek 36:2 . Metaph., of the neighing of a war horse in the battle, Job 39:25 .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB2039')\">BDB2039</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H1889')\">H1889</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB2038')\">BDB2038</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB2040')\">BDB2040</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>הֶאָח</bdbheb> <b>interjection</b> (onomatopoetic) expressing joy, <highlightword>Aha!</highlightword> always introduced by <bdbheb>אָמַר</bdbheb>, <ref ref=\"Isa 44:16\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"44\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"44\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(23,44,16)\">Isa 44:16</ref> he says, <highlight>Aha</highlight>, I am warm, I have seen the fire. Of satisfaction over the misfortune of an enemy or rival, <ref ref=\"Ps 35:21\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"35\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"35\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(19,35,21)\">Ps 35:21</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 35:25\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"35\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"35\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(19,35,25)\">Ps 35:25</ref> let them not say in their heart <bdbheb>הֶאָח נַפְשֵׁנוּ</bdbheb> <highlight>Aha</highlight>, so would we have it ! (<highlight>lit</highlight> our desire !) <ref ref=\"Ps 40:16\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"40\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"40\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(19,40,16)\">Ps 40:16</ref> (= <ref ref=\"Ps 70:4\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"70\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"70\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(19,70,4)\">Ps 70:4</ref>), <ref ref=\"Ezek 25:3\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(26,25,3)\">Ezek 25:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 26:2\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(26,26,2)\">Ezek 26:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 36:2\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"36\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"36\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(26,36,2)\">Ezek 36:2</ref>. Metaph., of the neighing of a war horse in the battle, <ref ref=\"Job 39:25\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"39\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"39\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(18,39,25)\">Job 39:25</ref>. </p><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "Isa 44:16", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 44, "verse": 16}, {"raw": "Ps 35:21", "book": "PSA", "chapter": 35, "verse": 21}, {"raw": "Ps 35:25", "book": "PSA", "chapter": 35, "verse": 25}, {"raw": "Ps 40:16", "book": "PSA", "chapter": 40, "verse": 16}, {"raw": "Ps 70:4", "book": "PSA", "chapter": 70, "verse": 4}, {"raw": "Ezek 25:3", "book": "EZK", "chapter": 25, "verse": 3}, {"raw": "Ezek 26:2", "book": "EZK", "chapter": 26, "verse": 2}, {"raw": "Ezek 36:2", "book": "EZK", "chapter": 36, "verse": 2}, {"raw": "Job 39:25", "book": "JOB", "chapter": 39, "verse": 25}], "flagged": {"hebrew": ["הֶאָח", "אָמַר", "הֶאָח נַפְשֵׁנוּ"], "aramaic": [], "greek": [], "translit": [], "abbreviations": []}, "covers": [], "bdbid": "BDB2039", "source": "BDB", "testament": "OT"}